# Mount the GCS service-account key here at runtime as:
#   credentials/firestore-credentials.json
#
# This is the SAME service account the assessment service uses (reused SA).
# The file is gitignored and is NEVER committed or baked into the Docker image —
# it is mounted via a volume / Kubernetes secret at deploy time. Locally, place
# the JSON here, or leave it absent to fall back to Application Default Credentials.
#
# Referenced by application.yml -> gcs.credentials.location =
#   file:credentials/firestore-credentials.json
